    "announcements": {
      "$comment": "GH-110 announcement lines: objective, deadline, loss, reinforcement and contact calls. Each carries an i18n caption key and an `audio` key that must exist in voices.lines (empty until recorded, ElevenLabs licence D5 unconfirmed): empty or unrecorded means caption only. Priority high > normal > low; a lower one stays quiet for hold_s after a higher one spoke. Polish pass F: mission_start (Shai on the net as the deploy gate clears, A4) and roe (a Conduct penalty, 'Check your fire', A9) are caption-only until the lead records them. Every announcement caption shows whatever the captions setting says (A5).",
      "hold_s": 3,
      "caption_s": 3.5,
      "events": {
        "objective_active": {
